OL,3,ADame Jenni Murray died days after car
OL,4,Acrash, inquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA statement from Dr Clare Morkane, a
OL,7,Fconsultant at the Royal Free Hospital
OL,8,Fwhere Dame Jenni died after being
OL,9,Fadmitted on 4 March, stated: "Jennifer
OL,10,Fhad been driving when she became
OL,11,Fdazzled by vehicle lights and collided
OL,12,Fwith two stationary vehicles."
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
