OL,3,ABBC director-general says he was not
OL,4,Aaware of 'severity' of cuts needed
OL,5,
OL,6,FBBC director-general Matt Brittin has
OL,7,Fsaid he was not aware of the severity
OL,8,Fof the cuts the corporation needed to
OL,9,Fmake when he took on his role.
OL,11,FSavings targets were announced in June,
OL,12,Fwith planned cuts across news, nations
OL,13,Fand content divisions to deliver #160m
OL,14,Fof #500m in savings by the 2028-29
OL,15,Ffinancial year.
OL,17,FSpeaking at the Edinburgh TV Festival
OL,18,Fon Thursday, Brittin said: "On the
OL,19,Ffinancial side, I knew that cuts had
OL,20,Fbeen announced and that savings had
OL,21,Fbeen announced, but I hadn't really
OL,22,Funderstood the severity."
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
