OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AJapanese polka dot artist Yayoi Kusama
OL,4,Adies aged 97
OL,5,
OL,6,FA statement from her company said:
OL,7,F"Throughout an extraordinary lifetime
OL,8,Fdevoted entirely to artistic creation,
OL,9,FKusama pursued an internationally
OL,10,Facclaimed career as a pioneering
OL,11,Favant-garde artist whose creative
OL,12,Fpractice encompassed visual art,
OL,13,Fperformance, fiction, and poetry."
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
